    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262610/extras/8776008b6a81631a90771b9404d25697.avif?t=1752706025\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2>Meet Penny, a corporate grunt and serial procrastinator who spent all her time at the office doodling comics and playing phone games instead of working on her project. Now a weekend away from missing her deadline, Penny must find inspiration and overcome all sorts of distractions to finish her project on time and not disappoint her mentor (and not get fired). And maybe she'll learn something about herself in the process.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the office and phone up friends and coworkers for ideas and inspiration<br></li><li>Avoid (or embrace) distractions from daydreams, video games, mysterious doors, and imaginary(?) friends<br></li><li>Behold the consequences of your actions through the story's multiple endings<br></li><li>Completely hand-drawn visuals, by me<br></li><li>Luxurious OST by the esteemed Chance Thrash<br></li><li>State-of-the-art &quot;you can use a mouse, keyboard, or controller to play the game&quot; technology</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262610/extras/69a92c4520788e012930d29b44bdfda7.avif?t=1752706025\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overtime!</h2>The end is no longer the end, as they say. Penny's story continues in this brand-new full-length extra chapter, included for free with the latest update!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262610/extras/8776008b6a81631a90771b9404d25697.avif?t=1752706025\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2>Meet Penny, a corporate grunt and serial procrastinator who spent all her time at the office doodling comics and playing phone games instead of working on her project. Now a weekend away from missing her deadline, Penny must find inspiration and overcome all sorts of distractions to finish her project on time and not disappoint her mentor (and not get fired). And maybe she'll learn something about herself in the process.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the office and phone up friends and coworkers for ideas and inspiration<br></li><li>Avoid (or embrace) distractions from daydreams, video games, mysterious doors, and imaginary(?) friends<br></li><li>Behold the consequences of your actions through the story's multiple endings<br></li><li>Completely hand-drawn visuals, by me<br></li><li>Luxurious OST by the esteemed Chance Thrash<br></li><li>State-of-the-art &quot;you can use a mouse, keyboard, or controller to play the game&quot; technology</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262610/extras/69a92c4520788e012930d29b44bdfda7.avif?t=1752706025\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overtime!</h2>The end is no longer the end, as they say. Penny's story continues in this brand-new full-length extra chapter, included for free with the latest update!",
